[[Tortureweb Dryder (boss)|Tortureweb Dryder]]s are the [[creature]]s that capture innocent souls that are used by [[Abaddon]] as a power source. They must be killed in the [[Gate of Pain]] mission.

== Missions ==
* [[Realm of Torment]]
** {{NPC location|Gate of Pain}}

== Skills ==
* {{skill icon|Aura of Restoration}}
* {{skill icon|Ether Prism}} ([[elite]])
* {{skill icon|Fireball}}
* {{skill icon|Lightning Bolt}}
* {{skill icon|Liquid Flame}}
* {{monster skill icon|Soul Torture}}

== Notes ==
* Because Soul Torture has a very long [[activation time]] without technically doing anything, consider waiting until the Tortureweb Dryder begins activating it before entering its [[aggro]] and engaging it. Avoid using [[interrupt]] skills or attacking it with weapons (because Soul Torture is [[easily interruptible]]) during this time.
* Make sure to spread out to prevent heavy [[area of effect]] damage from Liquid Flame and Fireball, which could overwhelm [[healer]]s if not careful.

